1
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:16,800
Who's there?

2
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:18,160
Who are you?

3
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:22,800
Who are you?

4
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,000
What kind of person are you?

5
00:00:52,520 --> 00:00:54,000
You ate all the food in the pot?

6
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:57,720
Was it good?

7
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:01,840
Muse.

8
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:04,080
I've finally found someone who understands me.

9
00:01:05,400 --> 00:01:07,200
This is great, this is amazing!

10
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:14,200
Sorry.

11
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:16,040
I just got a bit too emotional.

12
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:18,000
Let me introduce myself.

13
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:19,400
I’m the owner of this restaurant.

14
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,360
My name is Jian Dan.

15
00:01:20,440 --> 00:01:21,000
Hello.

16
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,600
Seems like she's not as scary as I thought.

17
00:01:26,160 --> 00:01:27,320
What’s your name?

18
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:29,640
My name is Ait.

19
00:01:30,240 --> 00:01:31,000
Ait?

20
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:32,520
Your name is really unusual.

21
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:36,160
Why were you sneaking into my kitchen to eat just now?

22
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,400
You didn’t have any money on you, did you?

23
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:40,200
Don't worry.

24
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:42,520
Our restaurant is still in its trial opening phase.

25
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:44,840
So right now, you can come in for free tastings.

26
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:48,440
Wandering around aimlessly isn’t a solution either.

27
00:01:48,880 --> 00:01:51,040
You need to find a place where you can eat and rest first.

28
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:53,880
Then figure out how to get Horace's crystal.

29
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:55,600
What are you thinking about?

30
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:58,600
I actually saw a hiring notice at the entrance.

31
00:01:58,680 --> 00:01:59,680
So I came in to apply for a job.

32
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,880
There should be a place to stay here, right?

33
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,720
I can also provide accommodations.

34
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:09,160
However, I have high standards for kitchen helpers.

35
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:11,280
Do you have any relevant work experience?

36
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:13,400
I was once the head chef on an interstellar battleship.

37
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,480
Head chef on an interstellar battleship?

38
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,519
I’ve never heard of that restaurant before.

39
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:18,960
But it doesn’t matter.

40
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:20,360
The fact that you think my cooking is good

41
00:02:20,480 --> 00:02:22,280
shows that we share the same culinary philosophy.

42
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:24,600
Ait,

43
00:02:25,160 --> 00:02:25,840
nice to work with you.

44
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:26,760
Work together?

45
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:28,400
Let’s collaborate.

46
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:39,160
Oh no, I'm late again!

47
00:02:39,280 --> 00:02:40,160
Where's my phone?

48
00:02:40,480 --> 00:02:41,280
Phone, phone!

49
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:47,040
Where's my phone?

50
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:50,120
Where did my phone go this time?

51
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:51,280
Get up for a moment.

52
00:02:58,120 --> 00:03:00,160
Here it is. Gosh, my brain!

53
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,000
Clothes, clothes.

54
00:03:07,040 --> 00:03:07,960
I'm off to work!

55
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,600
Stay put today.

56
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:11,640
Careful not to get caught and experimented on, alright?

57
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:14,040
Don't wear that outfit today.

58
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,040
I, the great one, can see the breach in your magnetic field.

59
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:25,280
Don't you have an important meeting today?

60
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:27,040
If you want to change your luck,

61
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,560
just follow my advice.

62
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,960
What are you even wearing?

63
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:48,440
Can wearing this really change my luck?

64
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,720
Is he messing with me?

65
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,120
Ms. Jiang Shan!

66
00:03:55,760 --> 00:03:56,640
Qi Miao!

67
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:58,520
I was wondering who it was.

68
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:00,160
You're dressed like a cabbage!

69
00:04:01,720 --> 00:04:02,960
Morning, Ms. Jiang Shan.

70
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,520
Hurry up and go.

71
00:04:04,560 --> 00:04:05,520
Why are you standing there dazed?

72
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:19,040
Glad I didn't wear that outfit.

73
00:04:19,080 --> 00:04:20,800
I almost wore the same thing as the boss!

74
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,119
Oh, right, Qi Miao.

75
00:04:22,879 --> 00:04:24,999
An investor will come to talk to you shortly.

76
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,600
It's about the project you were overseeing before.

77
00:04:27,400 --> 00:04:28,880
Don't say anything reckless during the meeting.

78
00:04:29,440 --> 00:04:31,360
If the investor asks,

79
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:34,240
just say that I worked on this project.

80
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:37,560
After all, they pay attention to reputation.

81
00:04:39,400 --> 00:04:39,960
Alright.

82
00:04:44,760 --> 00:04:45,400
Mr. Qin.

83
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,440
This is the overall outline of the story.

84
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:49,760
I'm not sure if this is what you're looking for.

85
00:04:50,960 --> 00:04:53,080
The plot is really rich.

86
00:04:54,520 --> 00:04:55,040
Mr. Wang.

87
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,080
Your company's scriptwriters,

88
00:04:57,160 --> 00:04:59,520
they're truly exceptional now.

89
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,360
You're too kind, Mr. Qin.

90
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,960
The credit goes to our Ms. Jiang,

91
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,720
who has been deeply dedicated to this project.

92
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:05,720
Mr. Qin,

93
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,720
Actually, when I was creating,

94
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,920
I had the same thought as you just mentioned.

95
00:05:10,040 --> 00:05:12,000
I didn't expect you to understand creativity so well.

96
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
So it was our Mr. Jiang who created this?

97
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:18,080
If it's personally handled by Mr. Jiang,

98
00:05:18,160 --> 00:05:19,120
then I can rest easy.

99
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,960
How can you even claim you created this?

100
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,360
You clearly didn't write a single word!

101
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,440
Alright,

102
00:05:24,520 --> 00:05:26,320
let's take a look at the actor selection for this project.

103
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:27,360
Take a look.

104
00:05:28,760 --> 00:05:29,240
Oh, right,

105
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:31,480
the lucky charm given by Hao Ruichi.

106
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:35,800
Are you sure dressing like this will help?

107
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:37,920
Trust me,

108
00:05:38,320 --> 00:05:40,320
this outfit will bring you good luck.

109
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:41,720
And also,

110
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:44,400
open these three lucky charms during the meeting.

111
00:05:44,520 --> 00:05:45,800
They'll bring you some benefits.

112
00:05:46,760 --> 00:05:47,520
Mr. Qin,

113
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:49,440
do you have any preferences

114
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,720
for the male lead this time?

115
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:52,920
I've been thinking about the lead role for a long time.

116
00:05:53,320 --> 00:05:54,480
And I'm thinking, what the heck...

117
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:55,400
Calm down.

118
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:58,440
What's wrong, Qi Miao?

119
00:05:59,000 --> 00:06:00,920
Do you have any opinions about the male lead casting?

120
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:03,600
Ping Changqing.

121
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,320
We’re discussing the male lead.

122
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:07,160
Why are you bringing up a female actress?

123
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,400
No, I...

124
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:11,080
Oh right!

125
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,960
How could I forget Ping Changqing?

126
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,480
Who says the protagonist in our show

127
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:17,720
has to be a man?

128
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:18,800
Think about it,

129
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,920
if we invite Ping Changqing,

130
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:24,040
pair her with the original female lead to form a sister duo,

131
00:06:24,160 --> 00:06:26,480
they might spark something unique.

132
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,360
This choice of lead is great!

133
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:29,560
Yes, yes.

134
00:06:29,640 --> 00:06:32,080
I also had thoughts about inviting Ping Changqing before.

135
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,240
Exactly.

136
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:34,240
Yes, Mr. Qin.

137
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:36,720
If it's a dual female lead,

138
00:06:36,800 --> 00:06:37,560
then it's absolutely perfect!

139
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:39,000
Can develop rich emotional storylines with our two male characters.

140
00:06:39,080 --> 00:06:40,640
Can develop rich emotional storylines with our two male characters.

141
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:43,640
Speaking of emotional storylines...

142
00:06:44,280 --> 00:06:45,280
I personally...

143
00:06:45,360 --> 00:06:47,000
have a little bit of my own thoughts.

144
00:06:47,520 --> 00:06:49,440
What kind of ridiculous fortune charm is this?

145
00:06:49,640 --> 00:06:50,840
Is it even reliable?

146
00:06:51,880 --> 00:06:53,920
I've been thinking about this for a long time.

147
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:54,960
Never give up.

148
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,680
What did you say?

149
00:06:57,080 --> 00:06:58,560
I said, what were you just saying?

150
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,400
I, I said...

151
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,080
Never give up.

152
00:07:02,200 --> 00:07:03,000
That's right!

153
00:07:03,960 --> 00:07:05,080
That's exactly what I think too.

154
00:07:05,440 --> 00:07:06,880
No romance storylines.

155
00:07:07,600 --> 00:07:08,200
Look at this...

156
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,240
Current dramas...

157
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,960
Always about falling in love.

158
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,800
It's like artificial sweetener in an industrial size.

159
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:13,800
Honestly...

160
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:15,560
I'm so sick of watching it.

161
00:07:15,680 --> 00:07:16,400
So, you see...

162
00:07:16,480 --> 00:07:17,760
I think for our drama...

163
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:19,400
We must firmly avoid romance storylines.

164
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,120
Miss,

165
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,320
you're amazing.

166
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,760
Your thoughts are exactly like mine!

167
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:25,880
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

168
00:07:28,360 --> 00:07:29,720
They can even keep this conversation going.

169
00:07:29,840 --> 00:07:30,800
But Mr. Qin...

170
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:32,960
If there's no romance storyline...

171
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:34,840
Then how is this story supposed to end?

172
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:37,280
This doesn't have anything!

173
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:38,040
Exactly.

174
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:39,520
That's right, it's nothing.

175
00:07:40,520 --> 00:07:41,400
Just imagine,

176
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:42,960
our protagonist,

177
00:07:43,080 --> 00:07:44,320
a lone hero,

178
00:07:44,440 --> 00:07:45,640
spending their entire life,

179
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:46,800
and in the end...

180
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:49,640
having absolutely nothing.

181
00:07:49,880 --> 00:07:51,640
Brilliant! Absolutely brilliant!

182
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:52,640
So, you see...

183
00:07:52,760 --> 00:07:53,880
What is creation?

184
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,120
This is what you call creation.

185
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:57,040
This is what you call a story!

186
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:58,480
Miss,

187
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,200
What's your name?

188
00:08:00,200 --> 00:08:01,960
I... My name is Qi Miao.

189
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,280
Your ideas are really remarkable too!

190
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:06,080
Take another look,

191
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:06,880
what's this?

192
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:08,040
A cabbage.

193
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:09,480
Cabbage... bringing fortune.

194
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:12,400
Miss, you're truly my lucky charm!

195
00:08:13,240 --> 00:08:13,920
I've made a decision.

196
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:14,960
For the upcoming project,

197
00:08:15,080 --> 00:08:17,640
you and our Teacher Jiang will

198
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,240
collaborate to complete it together.

199
00:08:20,440 --> 00:08:21,000
Mr. Wang,

200
00:08:21,240 --> 00:08:21,880
by then,

201
00:08:21,960 --> 00:08:24,040
make sure to include Qi Miao's name as well.

202
00:08:24,280 --> 00:08:25,240
Got it, Mr. Qin.

203
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,680
Thank you, Mr. Qin.

204
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:28,200
I promise I won’t let you down.

205
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,600
Do your best!

206
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:37,320
Sister Simplicity!

207
00:08:39,240 --> 00:08:39,959
Sister Simplicity!

208
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:42,560
Dongdong, what’s up?

209
00:08:43,160 --> 00:08:43,680
Sis,

210
00:08:43,920 --> 00:08:45,240
are you experimenting with blowing up the kitchen again?

211
00:08:46,079 --> 00:08:48,480
I'll give you one more chance to rephrase that.

212
00:08:48,599 --> 00:08:49,000
Sis,

213
00:08:49,320 --> 00:08:50,640
I’ve got good news for you this time.

214
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:53,160
I’ve come up with a way to help you attract more customers.

215
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:54,840
What’s the plan?

216
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,280
This is Lucky Jade.

217
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,880
As long as you agree to display it in your store for sale,

218
00:09:02,360 --> 00:09:03,480
it'll bring you good fortune.

219
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:05,680
What a worthless trinket!

220
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:06,720
I wouldn’t take it even if it’s free.

221
00:09:06,840 --> 00:09:09,120
But doesn’t it fit the theme of your store perfectly?

222
00:09:09,480 --> 00:09:11,040
Say that again.

223
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:12,320
Sis, don’t get mad.

224
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,400
I’ll even give you a commission later on.

225
00:09:14,840 --> 00:09:15,440
Oh, by the way, Sis,

226
00:09:15,880 --> 00:09:17,880
if anyone shows interest in this jade,

227
00:09:18,240 --> 00:09:20,680
just tell them to visit Boss Qi at 18 Sakura Street.

228
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:23,080
I’m off to the next shop.

229
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,440
Boss Qi, huh?

230
00:09:24,600 --> 00:09:25,960
Acting like it's the real deal!

231
00:09:28,640 --> 00:09:32,160
Why does this guy have Hao Ruichi's aura on him?

232
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:41,200
What are you doing over there?

233
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,640
Feeling this planet.

234
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:49,800
What’s wrong?

235
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:52,840
I’m here to thank you.

236
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,400
After listening to what you said today,

237
00:09:54,520 --> 00:09:56,560
not only did I gain the boss’s approval,

238
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,000
but I also got credited for the project.

239
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:00,840
If you want to thank someone, thank yourself.

240
00:10:01,280 --> 00:10:02,680
It wasn’t me who changed your fortune;

241
00:10:02,760 --> 00:10:03,840
it was you.

242
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,160
If you ever need help in the future,

243
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,280
feel free to ask me.

244
00:10:08,240 --> 00:10:08,720
By the way,

245
00:10:09,200 --> 00:10:10,640
last time you told me

246
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:13,240
I could help you replenish the energy of the crystal.

247
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:14,520
How can I do that?

248
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:18,440
I’m not sure how to replenish it for now.

249
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:21,160
But one thing I’m certain of is

250
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:22,840
the only person who can help me

251
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:24,040
is you.

252
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:29,560
Wow, I didn’t expect it,

253
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:30,920
but you can actually say

254
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:32,800
something worth listening to.

255
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:11,640
Could it be that a kiss

256
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,960
might speed up the crystal’s energy recovery?
